Date: Mon, 9 Nov 2026 10:38:24 -0800
Subject: [PATCH 186/188] XD Netplay: battle records list both full teams, and
 take each Pokemon's max HP from its save

A re-entering Pokemon that comes back damaged keeps its real max HP. A fainted Pokemon's status is no longer shown as cured.
---
 Source/Core/Core/HW/XDBattleRecorder.cpp      | 66 +++++++++++++++++--
 Source/Core/Core/HW/XDBattleRecorder.h        | 18 +++++
 .../UICommon/XDNetplay/BattleCustomizer.cpp   | 16 ++++-
 3 files changed, 93 insertions(+), 7 deletions(-)

